1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,900
Biashara yako inakua, lakini usimamizi wake unazidi kuwa mgumu?

2
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:16,000
Kutana na SMART MANAGER — mfumo wa kisasa unaokusaidia kusimamia biashara yako kwa urahisi, kwa sehemu moja.

3
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:24,700
Kutoka kwenye dashboard moja, pata picha kamili ya biashara yako na ufanye maamuzi kwa kujiamini.

4
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:34,500
Simamia mauzo, wateja, oda, ankara na malipo bila kurukaruka kwenye mifumo tofauti.

5
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:44,300
Jua bidhaa ulizonazo, zinazotoka, na zinazohitaji kuongezwa kabla hujakumbana na upungufu wa stock.

6
00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:54,300
Fuatilia mapato, matumizi, malipo na ripoti muhimu ili ujue biashara yako iko wapi.

7
00:00:54,300 --> 00:01:04,000
Dhibiti timu yako, majukumu na shughuli za biashara kwa mfumo uliopangwa kulingana na mahitaji yako.

8
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:13,500
Na ukiwa na swali, AI Assistant yako iko tayari kukusaidia kupata taarifa muhimu kwa urahisi.

9
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:20,000
Kutoka kwenye changamoto za kila siku, hadi kwenye udhibiti unaoeleweka.

10
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:25,000
SMART MANAGER. Anza kusimamia biashara yako kwa njia bora zaidi.
